description:
PT. Soto Energi Shakti (SOTO) is a new energy trading company, operating as the official distributor of Pertamina's non-subsidized industrial fuels. Our product portfolio covers Industrial Diesel Oil (IDO), Marine Fuel Oil (MFO), Biosolar B35/B40, Fuel Oil, and Biofuel.
We have been engaged by several principals to supply fuel to the mining, marine, power plant, and industrial sectors. As a new and fast-growing company, we are looking for a proactive, energetic, and independent Sales Executive to lead sales development in our trading division.
Key Responsibilities
We are seeking a dynamic and results-driven Sales Executive to join our team. In this role, you will be responsible for identifying and developing new business opportunities, managing client relationships, and driving sales growth in the fuel trading sector.
Build and expand a customer base in mining, marine, power plant, and other industrial sectors;
Identify and approach potential customers to promote and sell our fuel products (IDO, MFO, Solar B35/B40);
Negotiate and close sales deals in accordance with company pricing and credit policies;
Maintain strong relationships with existing customers and ensure excellent after-sales service;
Achieve monthly and annual sales targets;
Prepare regular sales reports and market updates for management.
Qualifications
Minimum Bachelor's degree (S1) in any field; business, marketing, or engineering background is a plus;
Minimum 1-2 years of experience in sales, preferably in fuel, energy, or industrial products; fresh graduates with strong communication skills and a passion for sales are welcome to apply;
Strong networking and communication skills;
Independent, self-driven, and able to work with minimal supervision;
Possess a valid driving license (SIM A) and own a vehicle (preferred);
Willing to travel for client visits.
Benefits
Competitive base salary;
Attractive sales commission and performance bonus;
BPJS Kesehatan & Ketenagakerjaan (health & employment insurance);
THR (holiday allowance);
Annual leave (12 days);
Work-from-home flexibility, with occasional site/client visits as required;
Opportunities for growth in a rapidly growing company.
How to apply: We're hiring immediately. Please submit your CV through Jobstreet, or directly via WhatsApp.
